    [Doc][Misc] Fix Qwen3.6 and Qwen3.8 model weight names and ModelScope links (#19814)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    This PR corrects the model weight names for `Qwen3.6-27B-w8a8c8-mxfp8`
    (removing the incorrect `-fa-` suffix) and adds the missing ModelScope
    download link for `Qwen3.8-27B-w8a8c8-mxfp8` in the documentation.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    No, this is a documentation-only update.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    Documentation changes only, verified links are correct.
    
